# Solemnity and Kitchen Finks (CR 702.79a, 122.6, 101.2): persist returns Finks "with a -1/-1 counter on it", but counters can't be
# put on a creature, entering included, so it returns with none - a 3/2 - and each time it dies after that it had no -1/-1
# counter, and persists again. Bolted twice, it is back both times, and Bot1 gains 2 life on each of its three entries.

